.TH MAKE_DEMO_TREE 1 "2026-09-11" "mu2edaq-file-reaper 0.1.0" "Mu2e DAQ Manual"
.SH NAME
make_demo_tree.py \- build a demo file tree and fake-usage file for mu2edaq-file-reaper
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B python tools/make_demo_tree.py
.I DIR
[\fB\-\-files\fR \fIN\fR] [\fB\-\-size\fR \fIBYTES\fR] [\fB\-\-days\fR \fID\fR]
[\fB\-\-used\-pct\fR \fIP\fR] [\fB\-\-total\fR \fIBYTES\fR] [\fB\-\-usage\-file\fR \fIFILE\fR]
[\fB\-\-random\-content\fR] [\fB\-\-seed\fR \fIS\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Creates
.I N
files under
.I DIR
(in a handful of subdirectories) whose modification and access times are
spread over the last
.I D
days, then writes a JSON file for the
.B reaper.fake_usage_file
test hook mapping the realpath of
.I DIR
to
.IR "[total, used, free]"
at
.I P
percent used.  Together with
.I config/mu2edaq-file-reaper-test.yaml
this lets the whole warning / critical / full walk be exercised on a laptop
without filling a disk: edit the
.I used
value in the JSON file while the reaper runs.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI \-\-files " N"
Number of files (default 200).
.TP
.BI \-\-size " BYTES"
Mean file size; each file is 0.5 to 1.5 times this (default 65536).
.TP
.BI \-\-days " D"
Age spread in days (default 30).
.TP
.BI \-\-used\-pct " P"
Fake used percentage (default 82).
.TP
.BI \-\-total " BYTES"
Fake capacity (default 100 MiB).
.TP
.BI \-\-usage\-file " FILE"
Where to write the JSON (default
.IR ./data/demo-usage.json ).
Existing entries for other paths are kept.
.TP
.B \-\-random\-content
Incompressible content, to exercise the incompressible-skip path.
.TP
.BI \-\-seed " S"
Random seed (default 1) for reproducible trees.
.SH EXAMPLE
.nf
python tools/make_demo_tree.py ./data/demo --files 300 --days 30 --used-pct 92
./start-mu2edaq-file-reaper.sh -c config/mu2edaq-file-reaper-test.yaml
mu2edaq-reaper --url http://localhost:5004 --admin-token demo-admin token create demo --scopes read,operate,admin --save
mu2edaq-reaper plan data-demo
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR mu2edaq-file-reaper (1),
.BR mu2edaq-file-reaper.conf (5)
